# 62. If Payment already exists

Don't overwrite everything.

First:

```python
if should_update_payment_status(
    payment.status,
    parsed_event.payment_status,
):
    payment.status = (
        parsed_event.payment_status
    )
```

Then:

```python
if parsed_event.failure_reason:
    payment.failure_reason = (
        parsed_event.failure_reason
    )

if parsed_event.failure_code:
    payment.failure_code = (
        parsed_event.failure_code
    )
```

