# 100. Part 7 final architecture

At the end of Part 7, the system should conceptually look like:

```text
                         RAZORPAY
                            │
                            │ POST
                            ▼
                 /webhooks/razorpay
                            │
                            ▼
                    Raw request body
                            │
                            ▼
                  HMAC-SHA256 verify
                            │
                  ┌─────────┴─────────┐
                  │                   │
                FAIL                 PASS
                  │                   │
                400                   ▼
                              Parse JSON
                                   │
                                   ▼
                          X-Razorpay-Event-Id
                                   │
                                   ▼
                         Resolve account_id
                                   │
                                   ▼
                            Organisation
                                   │
                                   ▼
                           webhook_events
                                   │
                          UNIQUE(provider,
                           provider_event_id)
                                   │
                         ┌─────────┴──────────┐
                         │                    │
                     duplicate              new
                         │                    │
                       200                    ▼
                                  [PART 8 WORKER]
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                  Parse payment event
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                       Customer
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                       Payment
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                   PaymentAttempt
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                PaymentFailedEvent
                                           │
                                           ▼
                                  [PART 9 Recovery]
```

---

# 101. What Part 7 gives RevRecover

You now have the beginning of the **real event-driven architecture**.

Before:

```text
Frontend
   ↓
FastAPI
   ↓
Database
```

Now:

```text
Razorpay
   ↓
Event
   ↓
Verified
   ↓
Persisted
   ↓
Idempotent
   ↓
Domain processing
```

This is a substantial difference.

Your future demo can eventually show:

```text
Razorpay Test Payment
        ↓
payment.failed
        ↓
RevRecover receives webhook
        ↓
Payment created
        ↓
PaymentAttempt recorded
        ↓
Recovery engine triggered
```

